
# <type>(<scope>)[!]: <subject>
#   subject: ≤50 chars, imperative ("add", not "added"), no trailing period
#
# <body>: wrap at 72; explain WHY and trade-offs, not how
#
# <trailers>: after a blank line, one "Key: value" per line
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Types:  feat · fix · perf · refactor · test · docs · build · ci
#         chore · style (formatting only) · revert
# Scope:  milestone for milestone commits (m03), else component
#         (api, worker, inference, infra, dashboard)
# Break:  feat(api)!: …   and/or footer   BREAKING CHANGE: <impact + migration>
# Spec:   https://www.conventionalcommits.org/en/v1.0.0/
#
# Trailers:
#   Closes #123                      (GitHub auto-closes the issue on merge)
#   Refs: #123, ADR-0007
#   Co-authored-by: Name <email>
#   Signed-off-by: …                 (use `git commit -s`, don't type it)
